{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03351","headline":"使过襄阳登凤林寺阁 · 宋之问","name":"使过襄阳登凤林寺阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"香阁临清汉，丹梯隐翠微。\n林篁天际密，人世谷中违。\n苔石衔仙洞，莲舟泊钓矶。\n山云浮栋起，江雨入庭飞。\n信美虽南国，严程限北归。\n幽寻不可再，留步惜芳菲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03351.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03351","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}